{"t":"KEY","made":"2026-11-11 10:29","name":"KeyCorp","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","employees":17562,"hq":"Cleveland, OH, United States","website":"https://www.key.com","summary_en":"KeyCorp operates as the holding company for KeyBank National Association that provides various retail and commercial banking products and services in the United States. It operates in two segments, Consumer Bank and Commercial Bank. The company offers various deposits and investment products; personal finance and financial wellness, lending, student loan refinancing, mortgage and home equity, credit card, treasury, and business advisory; commercial leasing, investment management, consumer finance; and wealth management and investment services for institutional, non-profit, and high-net-worth clients. It also provides lending, cash management, equipment financing, and commercial mortgage loans; and capital market products and services, such as syndicated finance, debt and equity underwriting, fixed income and equity sales and trading, derivatives, foreign exchange, mergers and acquisition, other advisory services, and public finance to large corporate and institutional clients. In addition, the company offers personal and institutional trust custody services, personal financial and planning services, access to mutual funds, treasury services, and international banking services. Further, it provides community development financing, securities underwriting, brokerage, and investment banking services, as well as merchant services. The company was founded in 1849 and is headquartered in Cleveland, Ohio.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"KeyCorp는 미국에서 다양한 소매 및 상업 은행 상품과 서비스를 제공하는 KeyBank National Association의 지주 회사로 운영됩니다. 소비자은행과 상업은행의 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 회사는 다양한 예금 및 투자 상품을 제공합니다. 개인 금융 및 재정 건강, 대출, 학자금 대출 재융자, 모기지 및 주택 담보, 신용 카드, 재무 및 비즈니스 자문; 상업용 임대, 투자 관리, 소비자 금융; 기관, 비영리, 고액 순자산 고객을 위한 자산 관리 및 투자 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 대출, 현금 관리, 장비 융자 및 상업 모기지 대출도 제공합니다. 신디케이트 금융, 부채 및 지분 인수, 채권 및 지분 판매 및 거래, 파생 상품, 외환, 인수 및 기타 자문 서비스, 대기업 및 기관 고객을 위한 공공 금융 등의 자본 시장 상품 및 서비스. 또한 회사는 개인 및 기관 신탁 보관 서비스, 개인 금융 및 계획 서비스, 뮤추얼 펀드 이용, 재무 서비스, 국제 금융 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 지역사회 개발 금융, 증권 인수, 중개, 투자 은행 서비스는 물론 가맹점 서비스도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1849년에 설립되었으며 오하이오주 클리블랜드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":21.34,"mcap":22534608896.0,"pe":11.725274,"fpe":9.811178,"peg":1.391,"ps":2.974866,"pb":1.4261845,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":3.83,"beta":1.068,"hi52":24.07,"lo52":16.91},"fin":{"rev":7575000064.0,"rev_g":0.115,"eps_g":0.244,"gross":0.0,"op":0.37216,"net":0.27987,"roe":0.11174,"fcf":null,"cash":2807000064.0,"debt":17984999424.0,"de":null,"eps":1.82,"feps":2.17507},"own":{"short":0.0,"inst":0.90707,"insider":0.00301},"analyst":{"n":20,"mean":25.13,"median":24.0,"high":43.0,"low":22.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.0,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":8,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":23.5,"priorPriceTarget":23.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"DA Davidson","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":27.0,"priorPriceTarget":26.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":24.0,"priorPriceTarget":25.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-05","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":25.0,"priorPriceTarget":27.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-02","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetActio